        "subject": "LU-21058 lnet: send connect RPCs without waiting for credits",
        "message": "LU-21058 lnet: send connect RPCs without waiting for credits\n\nWhen a server hangs or reboots, RPCs in flight to it can hold all\nof the client's peer tx credits until the LND times them out.  The\nreconnect queues behind them on lpni_txq, the import stays in\nCONNECTING, and the client misses the recovery window and is\nevicted (see also LU-18681).\n\nAdd msg_urgent to struct lnet_msg and an urgent flag to LNetPut()\nand LNetGet(): urgent messages neither take nor wait for LNet peer\nor NI tx credits.  Set it for connect requests and replies in\nptl_send_buf().  Add \"lnetctl ping --urgent\" to send an urgent ping,\nand use it in new sanity-lnet test_259.\n\nOST0000 failover with two clients (one idle, one with ~38 writes\nqueued on lpni_txq behind a 40s bulk REPLY delay):\n\nBefore this patch (obdfilter.lustre-OST0000.recovery_histogram):\n```\nrecovery_start:    1793412828\nreq_replay_start:  1793412866\nlock_replay_start: 1793412965\nrecovery_finish:   1793412965\nrecovery_time:     137\nreconnect_delay_seconds_samples: 2\nclient_reconnect_histogram:\n- { phase_sec:   8, clients:    1, pct:  50, cum_pct:  50 }\n- { phase_sec:  64, clients:    1, pct:  50, cum_pct: 100 }\nreq_replay_delay_seconds_samples: 2\nclient_req_replay_histogram:\n- { phase_sec:   1, clients:    1, pct:  50, cum_pct:  50 }\n- { phase_sec: 128, clients:    1, pct:  50, cum_pct: 100 }\nlock_replay_delay_seconds_samples: 2\nclient_lock_replay_histogram:\n- { phase_sec:   1, clients:    2, pct: 100, cum_pct: 100 }\n```\n\nAfter this patch (obdfilter.lustre-OST0000.recovery_histogram):\n```\nrecovery_start:    1793413659\nreq_replay_start:  1793413664\nlock_replay_start: 1793413690\nrecovery_finish:   1793413690\nrecovery_time:     31\nreconnect_delay_seconds_samples: 2\nclient_reconnect_histogram:\n- { phase_sec:   4, clients:    1, pct:  50, cum_pct:  50 }\n- { phase_sec:   8, clients:    1, pct:  50, cum_pct: 100 }\nreq_replay_delay_seconds_samples: 2\nclient_req_replay_histogram:\n- { phase_sec:   1, clients:    1, pct:  50, cum_pct:  50 }\n- { phase_sec:  32, clients:    1, pct:  50, cum_pct: 100 }\nlock_replay_delay_seconds_samples: 2\nclient_lock_replay_histogram:\n- { phase_sec:   1, clients:    2, pct: 100, cum_pct: 100 }\n```\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nTest-Parameters: testlist=recovery-small\nTest-Parameters: testlist=replay-single\nSigned-off-by: Jinshan Xiong <jinshanx@google.com>\nAssisted-by: Jetski:gemini-3.1-pro\nChange-Id: Ib0f51d271036e47b0d60bbcca1e262916424e8d3\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
